敕河南中部收縛拜者送獄，廣即便解遣。眾人代廣危懼。孫琰說賈謐曰：「前以太子罪惡，有斯廢黜，其臣不懼嚴詔，冒罪而送。今若系之，是彰太子之善，不如釋去。」謐然其言，廣故得不坐。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:line154:m0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"湣懷太子","kind":"person","person_id":"74e_68c_9ae","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:line154:m0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"滿奮","kind":"person","person_id":"m2r_kh3_98l","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:line154:m0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"591_360_8ca","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:line154:m0056","start":56,"end":57,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"591_360_8ca","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:line154:m0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"孫琰","kind":"person","person_id":"0ug_krg_w72","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:line154:m0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"賈謐","kind":"person","person_id":"ga3_phu_mfa","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:line154:m0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"74e_68c_9ae","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:line154:m0099","start":99,"end":101,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"74e_68c_9ae","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:line154:m0110","start":110,"end":111,"surface":"謐","kind":"person","person_id":"ga3_phu_mfa","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:line154:m0115","start":115,"end":116,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"591_360_8ca","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":154,"last_line":154,"raw_start":12131,"raw_end":12254,"revision_id":2618531},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang","book_id":"b-jinshu-043","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-043-leguang"},{"id":"c-jinshu-053-jin096-huifeng:two-daughters","text":"而為太子聘王衍小女惠風。太子聞衍長女美，而賈后為謐聘之，心不能平，頗以為言。","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-053-jin096-huifeng:two-daughters:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"王衍","kind":"person","person_id":"b0c_13f_c3a","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-053-jin096-huifeng:two-daughters:m0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"惠風","kind":"person","person_id":"y5y_cch_05n","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-053-jin096-huifeng:two-daughters:m0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"衍","kind":"person","person_id":"b0c_13f_c3a","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-053-jin096-huifeng:two-daughters:m0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"賈后","kind":"person","person_id":"c27_590_7e3_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-053-jin096-huifeng:two-daughters:m0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"謐","kind":"person","person_id":"ga3_phu_mfa","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","source_quote":{"witness":"ws53","quote":"而為太子聘王衍小女惠風。太子聞衍長女美，而賈后為謐聘之，心不能平，頗以為言。","raw_start":1172,"raw_end":1210,"raw_line":18},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-053-jin096-huifeng","book_id":"b-jinshu-053","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-053-jin096-huifeng"},{"id":"c-jinshu-053-minhuai-yu:p004","text":"太子性剛，知賈謐恃后之貴，不能假借之。謐至東宮，或舍之而於後庭遊戲。詹事裴權諫曰：「賈謐甚有寵于中宮，而有不順之色，若一旦交構，大事去矣。宜深自謙屈，以防其變，廣延賢士，用自輔翼。」太子不能從。初，賈后母郭槐欲以韓壽女為太子妃，太子亦欲婚韓氏以自固。而壽妻賈午及后皆不聽，而為太子聘王衍小女惠風。太子聞衍長女美，而賈后為謐聘之，心不能平，頗以為言。謐嘗與太子圍棋，爭道，成都王穎見而訶謐，謐意愈不平，因此譖太子于后曰：「太子廣買田業，多畜私財以結小人者，為賈氏故也。密聞其言云：『皇后萬歲後，吾當魚肉之。』非但如是也，若宮車晏駕，彼居大位，依楊氏故事，誅臣等而廢后於金墉，如反手耳。不如早為之所，更立慈順者以自防衛。」后納其言，又宣揚太子之短，布諸遠近。于時朝野咸知賈后有害太子意。中護軍趙俊請太子廢后，太子不聽。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":18,"last_line":18,"raw_start":1036,"raw_end":1423,"raw_character_offsets":[1036,1037,1038,1039,1040,1041,1042,1043,1044,1045,1046,1047,1048,1049,1050,1051,1052,1053,1054,1055,1056,1057,1058,1059,1060,1061,1062,1063,1064,1065,1066,1067,1068,1069,1070,1071,1072,1073,1074,1075,1076,1077,1078,1079,1080,1081,1082,1083,1084,1085,1086,1087,1088,1089,1090,1091,1092,1093,1094,1095,1096,1097,1098,1099,1100,1101,1102,1103,1104,1105,1106,1107,1108,1109,1110,1111,1112,1113,1114,1115,1116,1117,1118,1119,1120,1121,1122,1123,1124,1125,1126,1127,1128,1129,1130,1131,1132,1133,1134,1135,1136,1137,1138,1139,1140,1141,1142,1143,1144,1145,1146,1147,1148,1149,1150,1151,1152,1153,1154,1155,1156,1157,1158,1159,1160,1161,1162,1163,1164,1165,1166,1167,1168,1169,1170,1171,1172,1173,1174,1175,1176,1177,1178,1179,1180,1181,1182,1183,1184,1185,1186,1187,1188,1189,1190,1191,1192,1193,1194,1195,1196,1197,1198,1199,1200,1201,1202,1203,1204,1205,1206,1207,1208,1209,1210,1211,1212,1213,1214,1215,1216,1217,1218,1219,1220,1221,1222,1223,1224,1225,1226,1227,1228,1229,1230,1231,1232,1233,1234,1235,1236,1237,1238,1239,1240,1241,1242,1243,1244,1245,1246,1247,1248,1249,1250,1251,1252,1253,1254,1255,1256,1257,1258,1259,1260,1261,1262,1263,1264,1265,1266,1267,1268,1269,1270,1271,1272,1273,1274,1275,1276,1277,1278,1279,1280,1281,1282,1283,1284,1285,1286,1287,1288,1289,1290,1291,1292,1293,1294,1295,1296,1297,1298,1299,1300,1301,1302,1303,1304,1305,1306,1307,1308,1309,1310,1311,1312,1313,1314,1315,1316,1317,1318,1319,1320,1321,1322,1323,1324,1325,1326,1327,1328,1329,1330,1331,1332,1333,1334,1335,1336,1337,1338,1339,1340,1341,1342,1343,1344,1345,1346,1347,1348,1349,1350,1351,1352,1353,1354,1355,1356,1357,1358,1359,1360,1361,1362,1363,1364,1365,1366,1367,1368,1369,1370,1371,1372,1373,1374,1375,1376,1377,1378,13